-02 no reproduce los incidentes reales&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:40px&quot;&gt;R-037 · Media&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=25;spacingRight=18;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="2044" width="440" height="254" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5433;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;html=1;endArrow=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="n1.14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n1.15" value="&lt;b&gt;1.15&lt;/b&gt;  INN-03 estima vida útil sin validación suficiente&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:40px&quot;&gt;R-038 · Alta&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=25;spacingRight=18;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="2318" width="440" height="309" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5433;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;html=1;endArrow=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="n1.15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · Integración y legado&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:43px&quot;&gt;7 riesgos&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=25;spacingRight=18;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="323" width="500" height="215" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2.1" value="&lt;b&gt;2.1&lt;/b&gt;  Interfaces del 